  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "In Selfie Expression, I am able to select a webcam device. However, my specific camera supports 720P 120FPS OR 1080P 60FPS, and I can't select the exact resolution/framerate I would like to use, just the camera. I would like to be able to select the framerate/resolution of my Selfie Expression camera.\n\nThis can also help users with lower end computers that want to downscale the resolution to help the load on their computer without lowering the Selfie Expression quality level, or as a tradeoff, or even for those who want selfie expression and struggle even at the lowest quality. Some cameras have different features depending on the framerate/resolution you set them to, eg. some cameras only support HDR/exposure at specific FPS/res's. Some cameras even overheat and this can solve those issues.",
